            'en' => ['name' => 'Dokkaebi Goblin Ceramic Mug', 'short' => 'The mischievous goblin of Korean folktales.', 'intro' => 'Horned, blue-faced and carrying a magic club, the **dokkaebi** is Korea\'s friendliest monster: a trickster who rewards kindness and loves a good wrestling match. Now he guards your coffee.', 'bullets' => ['Full-wrap print in bold, saturated color', 'Glossy ceramic, dishwasher and microwave safe', 'Black or white mug options'], 'story' => 'Dokkaebi are born from objects people use and forget — an old broom, a worn-out bowl. Treat them well, and they\'ll make you rich. Treat them badly, and they\'ll make a mess.'],
